  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kWHWJxf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Minecraft: Reborn — это идеальный модпак в стиле Vanilla+.</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Более 40 новых биомов, 80 новых структур и 120 новых мобов: всё доработано и улучшено, при этом полностью сохраняется дух ванильного Minecraft.</span><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ArqVxua.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"95\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RFQHFRq.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QqKOuWL.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1008\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WtMCVqu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1323\" height=\"847\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PFE3IA7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tJVIasL.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1323\" height=\"847\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jDuUq2Z.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1168\" height=\"876\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/37D3YQs.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PI6cJsF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1187\" height=\"890\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IgwNpPb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1323\" height=\"847\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lOyDR8m.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OoMgg4x.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1008\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EN9wcxp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1008\"></p>",
